<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Inflio — Verify your email</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f8f9fb; font-family: "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; }
    .wrap { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
    .head { background: #1e1e2f; padding: 28px; text-align: center; }
    .head h1 { color: #fff; margin: 0; font-size: 22px; }
    .body { padding: 32px 28px; }
    .body p { line-height: 1.6; color: #4a4a4a; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; background: #4f46e5; color: #fff !important; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; margin: 16px 0; }
    .code { text-align: center; background: #f1f3ff; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: 8px; font-weight: bold; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0; color: #1e1e2f; }
    .foot { background: #f3f4f6; padding: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: #666; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head"><h1>Verify your Inflio account</h1></div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Hi <%= user.name %>,</p>
      <p>Thanks for signing up as a <strong><%= user.role %></strong>. Confirm your email to activate your account.</p>
      <p style="text-align:center">
        <a class="btn" href="<%= verifyUrl %>">Verify email address</a>
      </p>
      <p>Or enter this code on the verification page (valid for 24 hours):</p>
      <div class="code"><%= verificationCode %></div>
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #888;">If you did not create an account, you can ignore this email.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="foot">© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Inflio</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
